    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can u explain exactly what the seller is responsible for under CIF Incoterms 2020? specifically for a shipment of electronics",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Under CIF Incoterms 2020, the seller is responsible for all costs and risks associated with bringing the goods (your electronics) to the named port of destination. This includes contracting and paying for main carriage and insurance up to that port. The seller's responsibility ends once the goods are loaded onto the vessel at the port of origin, at which point the risk transfers to the buyer.",
      "source": "target",
